          },
          "description": "Two years have passed since Moog and Rockford’s first adventure on the magical, Island of Infinity. When they returned, many people believed Moog’s amazing story about the land of extinct creatures, although others said he’d just made it all up. \n\nOne man who’d believed everything was the strange Dr. Ermine Skinner, a collector of rare animals. But when he sets off to the island, Moog and Rockford find they are the only ones who can stop him and save the creatures of Infinity.",
